  'Embedded analytics and business intelligence platform that puts data-driven insights inside the applications your teams already use.', 'Sisense is a business intelligence and embedded analytics software company founded in 2004 in Tel Aviv, Israel, and now headquartered in New York City. The platform enables organizations to embed analytics directly into applications and workflows using its Compose SDK and AI-powered Sisense Fusion suite. Sisense serves over 2,000 customers across financial services, healthcare, supply chain, and technology sectors. The company achieved unicorn status in January 2020.', 'https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=sisense.com&sz=256',
  2004, '500+', 'https://www.linkedin.com/company/sisense', 'https://twitter.com/sisense', 'https://www.facebook.com/Sisense',
  'company', 0, '["Business Intelligence","Embedded Analytics","Data Visualization","AI Analytics"]', '["Financial Services","Healthcare","Supply Chain","Technology","Manufacturing","Retail"]', '["English"]', NULL, '[{"question":"Where is Sisense headquartered?","answer":"Sisense is headquartered in New York City, New York, US, with additional offices in Tel Aviv and other global locations."},{"question":"What industries does Sisense serve?","answer":"Sisense serves customers in financial services, healthcare, supply chain, technology, manufacturing, and retail, among others."},{"question":"What is Sisense Fusion?","answer":"Sisense Fusion is an AI-driven analytics suite that uses machine learning to deliver intelligent insights, automate data analysis, and enable customizable dashboards by industry and business role."},{"question":"Does Sisense offer embedded analytics?","answer":"Yes, Sisense is a leading embedded analytics platform. Its Compose SDK allows product teams to integrate analytics directly into their own applications with full customization control."},{"question":"When was Sisense founded?","answer":"Sisense was founded in 2004 in Tel Aviv, Israel, by Elad Israeli, Aviad Harell, Guy Boyangu, and Adi Azaria. The company expanded to the US in 2012."}]',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '["GMT-05:00 (Eastern)"]',
  '[{"name":"Embedded Analytics / Compose SDK","percentage":40},{"name":"Business Intelligence Platform","percentage":30},{"name":"AI and Generative Analytics (Sisense Fusion)","percentage":20},{"name":"Data Connectivity and Modeling","percentage":10}]', '[{"name":"SMB","percentage":20},{"name":"Mid-Market","percentage":45},{"name":"Enterprise","percentage":35}]', '[{"name":"PagerDuty","website":"https://www.pagerduty.com"},{"name":"Philips","website":"https://www.philips.com"},{"name":"Seismic","website":"https://seismic.com"}]', 'Sisense serves over 2,000 customers including PagerDuty, Philips, Skullcandy, and Seismic across multiple industries.',
