  'Digital asset management platform that helps organizations organize, control, distribute, and measure all their digital assets.', 'Brandfolder is a digital asset management (DAM) platform founded in 2012 and headquartered in Denver, Colorado. Acquired by Smartsheet in August 2020 for $155 million, Brandfolder enables marketing, creative, and operations teams to store, organize, and share brand assets at scale. The platform includes Brand Intelligence for AI-powered tagging, custom portals, a Smart CDN, and native integration with Smartsheet. Customers span industries including food and beverage, sports, retail, financial services, and technology.', 'https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=brandfolder.com&sz=256',
