  'AI-powered cloud phone and customer communications platform trusted by over 23,000 companies worldwide.', 'Aircall is a cloud-based VoIP and customer communications platform founded in 2014, headquartered in New York with additional offices in Paris, Sydney, Madrid, and Berlin. The platform enables sales and support teams to manage voice, SMS, and WhatsApp conversations from a single interface, with AI-powered call analytics, automated workflows, and over 250 native integrations. Aircall serves more than 23,000 businesses globally and employs approximately 837 people.', 'https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=aircall.io&sz=256',
