  'Product analytics and digital adoption platform that helps companies understand user behavior and improve software experiences.', 'Pendo is a product experience platform founded in 2013 and headquartered in Raleigh, North Carolina. It combines product analytics, in-app guidance, session replay, user feedback, and roadmapping tools in a single platform. Pendo processes over 20 billion daily events and serves more than 14,000 companies across 115 industries, including Fortune 500 enterprises and leading B2B SaaS companies. Customers include Verizon, Morgan Stanley, Okta, Salesforce, and Zendesk.', 'https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=pendo.io&sz=256',
