  'All-in-one CRM and sales automation platform built for B2B teams that want to close more deals without the complexity.', 'Nutshell is a cloud-based CRM and sales automation platform founded in 2009 and headquartered in Ann Arbor, Michigan. Designed for small to mid-sized B2B organizations, Nutshell provides contact management, pipeline tracking, email marketing, sales automation, SMS outreach, and AI-assisted prospecting in a single platform. The company supports over 5,000 businesses across 50 countries and has offices in Ann Arbor, New York, Cape Town, and Sydney.', 'https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=nutshell.com&sz=256',
