  'Cloud-based HR and payroll platform that helps mid-sized businesses manage their entire employee lifecycle in one place.', 'Paylocity is a cloud-based payroll and human capital management (HCM) software company founded in 1997 and headquartered in Schaumburg, Illinois. The company serves more than 40,000 mid-sized businesses across the US, primarily organizations with 50 to 1,000 employees. Paylocity''s platform covers payroll, time and labor, benefits administration, recruiting, onboarding, performance management, and workforce analytics. Paylocity trades on NASDAQ under the ticker PCTY and employs approximately 6,700 people.', 'https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=paylocity.com&sz=256',
