  'AI-powered finance automation platform for global accounts payable, mass payments, procurement, and expense management.', 'Tipalti is a financial technology company founded in 2010 and headquartered in Foster City, California, that automates end-to-end accounts payable, global mass payments, procurement, and expense management. The platform processes payments to 200+ countries in 120 currencies using 50+ payment methods and integrates with leading ERPs including NetSuite, Sage Intacct, SAP, QuickBooks, and Xero. Tipalti serves mid-market to enterprise companies and reached a $2 billion valuation after raising $150 million in 2021. The company has been named a CNBC World''s Top Fintech Company for three consecutive years.', 'https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=tipalti.com&sz=256',
