  'We design, build, and run integrated human + AI operations inside the world''s most complex enterprises.', 'Concentrix is a global business process outsourcing and customer experience company serving Fortune Global 500 clients across more than 70 countries. Founded as a SYNNEX business unit in 2006, it spun off as an independent public company in 2020 and trades on Nasdaq under CNXC. The company blends digital operations, enterprise technology, data analytics, and strategy consulting to manage billions of human and AI interactions annually.', 'https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=concentrix.com&sz=256',
