  'End-to-end app development, strategy, and design for next-generation digital experiences.', 'Mutual Mobile is an Austin-based digital product agency founded in 2009, now operating as a Grid Dynamics company following its 2022 acquisition. The agency specializes in mobile app development (iOS and Android), AR/VR, IoT, cloud-native development, and UX/UI design for technology startups and Fortune 500 enterprises. Mutual Mobile operates out of Austin, Texas, and Hyderabad, India, with approximately 200 employees across both locations.', 'https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=mutualmobile.com&sz=256',
