  'Human-first AI transformation - bridging where enterprises are today to where AI can take them.', 'Cprime is an enterprise technology transformation consultancy founded in 2003, backed by Goldman Sachs Asset Management and Everstone Capital. The company has worked with over 2,500 enterprises across 30 countries, including 300+ Fortune 500 companies, and is Atlassian''s largest and longest-standing Solution Partner. Cprime''s services span agile transformation, cloud migration, AI enablement, DevOps, Atlassian platform implementation, and staffing and talent solutions.', 'https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=cprime.com&sz=256',
