  'A digital product agency building the future of digital for Fortune 500 companies and next-generation startups.', 'Dom & Tom is a New York-based digital product agency founded in 2009 by Dominic and Thomas Tancredi, with additional offices in Chicago and Los Angeles. The agency specializes in UX/UI design, mobile app development (iOS and Android), custom web development, and emerging technologies, having delivered 500+ web projects and 120+ native mobile applications. Dom & Tom is an Inc. 500 Fastest Growing Company and Clutch Global and Champion Award winner, serving enterprise clients including GE, McDonald''s, Hearst, Bloomberg, and Citibank.', 'https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=domandtom.com&sz=256',
