  'company', 0, '["Digital Product Agency","Custom Web Development","Mobile Apps","UX/UI Design","Enterprise"]', '["Manufacturing","Energy","Financial Services","Media","Healthcare","Nonprofit","Government"]', '["English"]', '[{"name":"Inc. 500 Fastest Growing Company","year":2017},{"name":"Clutch Global Award","year":2023},{"name":"Clutch Champion Award","year":2023}]', '[{"question":"What types of projects does Dom & Tom take on?","answer":"Dom & Tom builds enterprise business applications, customer portals, iOS and Android mobile apps, and custom websites, with project sizes ranging from $10,000 to nearly $1 million."},{"question":"Who are Dom & Tom''s clients?","answer":"Dom & Tom serves enterprise clients including GE, McDonald''s, Tyson, Hearst, Bloomberg, Citibank, Fitch Ratings, Dignity Health, Priceline, and ideeli."},{"question":"What is Dom & Tom''s minimum project size?","answer":"Dom & Tom''s minimum project size is $75,000+, reflecting their focus on substantive digital product engagements for mid-market and enterprise clients."},{"question":"What awards has Dom & Tom received?","answer":"Dom & Tom is an Inc. 500 Fastest Growing Company and has received Clutch Global and Champion Awards. The agency maintains a 4.8/5.0 Clutch rating from 24 verified reviews."},{"question":"Where does Dom & Tom operate?","answer":"Dom & Tom is headquartered in New York City (2 Wall Street) with additional offices in Chicago and Los Angeles, serving clients across the United States and internationally."}]',
