  '[{"name":"UX/UI Design","percentage":35},{"name":"Mobile App Development","percentage":30},{"name":"Web Development","percentage":25},{"name":"Low/No Code Development","percentage":10}]', '[{"name":"Midmarket ($10M - $1B)","percentage":60},{"name":"Enterprise (>$1B)","percentage":30},{"name":"Small Business (<$10M)","percentage":10}]', '[{"name":"GE","website":"https://www.ge.com"},{"name":"McDonald''s","website":"https://www.mcdonalds.com"},{"name":"Bloomberg","website":"https://www.bloomberg.com"},{"name":"Citibank","website":"https://www.citi.com"}]', 'Dom & Tom serves enterprise and Fortune 500 clients including GE, McDonald''s, Tyson, Hearst, Bloomberg, Citibank, and Fitch Ratings across manufacturing, finance, and media sectors.',
