  'Integrated accounting, tax, and CFO services for startups and growing businesses.', 'inDinero was founded in 2009 by Jessica Mah and Andy Su as a Y Combinator-backed startup, originally as accounting software, later evolving into a full-service financial operations firm. The company provides bookkeeping, tax preparation, CFO advisory, payroll, and financial planning to startups and small-to-midsize businesses across tech, healthcare, SaaS, and construction. inDinero has grown through acquisitions including tempCFO and mAccounting, offering both software and expert human accountants.', 'https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=indinero.com&sz=256',
