  'A research-based, interdisciplinary architecture and design firm operating studios in 24 cities worldwide.', 'Perkins and Will was founded in 1935 by Lawrence Perkins and Philip Will Jr. in Chicago, Illinois, and is one of the largest architecture and design firms globally with approximately 2,600 professionals. The firm is widely recognized as a global leader in sustainable, research-driven design across healthcare, science and technology, education, workplace, and urban design. A subsidiary of Dar Al-Handasah since 1986, the firm has received numerous accolades including Interior Design''s ''Sustainability Giant'' designation and Architizer''s ''Best Sustainable Firm'' award.', 'https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=perkinswill.com&sz=256',
