  'A global design and consulting firm committed to designing with community in mind across infrastructure, environment, and buildings.', 'Stantec was founded in 1954 in Edmonton, Alberta as D.R. Stanley Associates and has grown into one of the world''s top engineering and design firms with over 30,000 employees across 450+ locations on six continents. Publicly traded on both the TSX and NYSE under the ticker STN, the firm provides planning, engineering, architecture, environmental sciences, and project management to public and private clients. Stantec was ranked eighth overall on Corporate Knights'' 2025 100 Most Sustainable Corporations in the World, and first among industry peers.', 'https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=stantec.com&sz=256',
