  'A global specialist recruitment consultancy placing professionals across finance, technology, legal, HR, and engineering in 31 countries.', 'Robert Walters was founded in 1985 by Robert Walters in London, originally focused on placing accountants, and has grown into a global specialist recruitment business listed on the London Stock Exchange (LSE: RWA) with operations in 31 countries. The firm recruits permanent, contract, and interim professionals across accounting and finance, banking, technology, HR, legal, sales, marketing, supply chain, and engineering. In 2024, Robert Walters unified its three operating brands into a single ''Robert Walters'' brand. Revenue was £781.1 million in 2025.', 'https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=robertwalters.com&sz=256',
