  'A leading independent investment bank specializing in M&A advisory, restructuring, and capital markets for complex, high-value transactions.', 'Perella Weinberg Partners (PWP) was founded in 2006 by Joseph R. Perella, Peter A. Weinberg, and Tarek Abdel-Meguid to provide conflict-free advisory services to corporations, institutions, and governments. The firm employs approximately 700 professionals across offices in New York, London, Paris, Munich, Houston, San Francisco, Los Angeles, Chicago, Denver, and Calgary. PWP went public in 2021 (NASDAQ: PWP) and reported revenue of $878 million in 2024. The firm is known for advising on landmark transactions including Medtronic''s $42.9 billion acquisition of Covidien and AT&T''s $108.7 billion acquisition of Time Warner.', 'https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=pwpartners.com&sz=256',
